{"id": "EUVD-2026-92157", "enisaUuid": "51b79214-a544-3f8e-b5c1-8e46ce2b9d38", "description": "Legcord 1.1.0 through 1.3.0 contains a path traversal vulnerability in theme IPC handlers that allows script in the Discord page to escape the themes directory via unvalidated theme ids. Attackers running script in the Discord origin, such as through XSS, can abuse themes.folder, themes.uninstall, and themes.install to launch local executables, recursively delete directories, and write files outside the themes directory.", "datePublished": "2026-10-05T00:44:18", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-05T14:55:10", "baseScore": 9.2, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:H/AT:P/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/Legcord/Legcord/issues/1163", "https://github.com/Legcord/Legcord", "https://github.com/Legcord/Legcord/blob/v1.3.0/src/discord/ipc.ts#L201-L206", "https://github.com/Legcord/Legcord/blob/v1.3.0/src/common/themes.ts#L269-L276", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/legcord-1.1.0-through-1.3.0-path-traversal-via-theme-ipc-handlers"], "aliases": ["GHSA-m6xw-v6hf-7jc2", "CVE-2026-105293"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.38, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "ec189c57-d6a7-3de0-8c51-50077e18b757", "product": {"name": "Legcord", "vendor": {"name": "Legcord"}}, "product_version": "1.1.0 \u22641.3.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "6d44fb2f-bf54-3d7b-b618-e3ccb658c70f", "vendor": {"name": "Legcord"}}], "isExploited": false}